WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.590
- So wait, you and Nick have a ritual

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:02.423
that I didn't know about.

00:00:02.423 --> 00:00:03.480
So it's called show and tell.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.313
This is pretty cute.

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:05.146
Explain-

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:05.979
- It kind of isn't a ritual,

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:08.235
it just happened because of necessity.

00:00:08.235 --> 00:00:11.130
We both didn't know very much
about each other's careers.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.750
I mean, I know of the Jonas Brothers,

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:14.400
but you know, it's a different generation.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:15.233
- Yeah.

00:00:15.233 --> 00:00:17.038
- I was like, I didn't
really grow up with the music

00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:19.080
and so I didn't know the history,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.360
even though him and I
both have 22 year careers,

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.651
'cause he started his at seven.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:23.781
- Yeah.

00:00:23.781 --> 00:00:27.000
- But so we started showing
each other each other's work.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.410
Like, we would sit and
be like, "Oh, you know,

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:31.080
this was the most traumatic day

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.850
on set for me when my first movie."

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.130
And he was like, "Oh this
was my most traumatic show."

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.893
And we'd kind of show
each other our careers

00:00:37.893 --> 00:00:39.330
or highlights from our careers

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.340
and talk about what we were
really feeling that time.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.830
And it's just become this
thing that we do whenever-

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:44.663
- [Kelly] That's cool.

00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:46.350
- We're by ourselves at home.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.970
We just go down the rabbit hole.

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.319
- Because y'all met and y'all got together

00:00:49.319 --> 00:00:50.910
pretty quickly, right?
- Yeah.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:53.340
So it's kind of cool, you get
to know each other like still.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.890
- Yeah, I mean, we knew each
other for about two years.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:56.723
- Yeah.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.722
- But we didn't like really date.

00:00:58.722 --> 00:01:00.904
We were both in other things.

00:01:00.904 --> 00:01:03.150
- Like other jobs and stuff, yeah?

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.009
- No, other relationships.

00:01:04.009 --> 00:01:04.842
- Oh, other relationships.

00:01:04.842 --> 00:01:06.533
Oh yeah.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:07.550
Totally.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.836
Thought you meant jobs.

00:01:08.836 --> 00:01:10.580
- I was trying to be subtle.

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:12.330
- We both weren't sure.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.470
I think that's awesome though.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:14.730
Like to show like...

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.770
I don't know, I just
think it's a very cute way

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:18.660
to like get to know your significant other

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.063
that you think you know everything about.

00:01:20.063 --> 00:01:22.050
But they weren't there
for that whole time.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:22.883
- They weren't, right.

00:01:22.883 --> 00:01:24.660
And I think it's such a fun thing to...

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:26.670
Especially both of us have
had such public careers.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.370
We've both grown up in our own way.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.390
- I love that you both didn't know

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.290
each other's careers either.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.123
- I know, it's so crazy.

00:01:32.123 --> 00:01:32.956
- That's kind of cool.

00:01:32.956 --> 00:01:34.050
- I think so too.

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:34.883
It's really fun.

00:01:34.883 --> 00:01:35.716
Like, you know-

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:36.549
- [Kelly] You're there
for the right reasons.

00:01:36.549 --> 00:01:38.310
- And we show each other
our embarrassing moments

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:39.480
'cause you know, that's your person

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.470
and you're safe with them.

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:41.400
- Yeah.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.233
And it's funny.

00:01:42.233 --> 00:01:44.250
- I show him my bad performances
and be able to laugh at it.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.083
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:46.783
Oh, me too, I have plenty.

